            "text": "The `Detail` toggle pops up a shortened pokemon detail panel.\n\nIt functions in the exact same way as the pokemon detail panel\nin the team menu except it does NOT have:\n- Level up button\n- OOR Level\n- Favorited/Locked Icons\n- Starting move box\n- Moves button\n",
            "fontSize": 10.714285714285714,
            "baseFontSize": 10.714285714285714,
            "fontFamily": 8,
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": "6PUkDiJMhdXQ9p42XKFJh",
            "originalText": "The `Detail` toggle pops up a shortened pokemon detail panel.\n\nIt functions in the exact same way as the pokemon detail panel in the team menu except it does NOT have:\n- Level up button\n- OOR Level\n- Favorited/Locked Icons\n- Starting move box\n- Moves button\n",
            "autoResize": true,
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "labelPosition": null
        },
